<title>UK: Msas' Corpe to join BA World Cargo.</title>
<headline>Msas' Corpe to join BA World Cargo.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Geoff Corpe, UK managing director of international forwarder MSAS Cargo International will join British Airways PLC World Cargo as sales and marketing director, an MSAS spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>Corpe, who has been in his post at MSAS since 1990 and is expected to leave the company towards the end of this year, she added.</p>
<p>No comment on the appointment was immediately available from World Cargo.</p>
<p>--Air Cargo Newsroom Tel+44 171 542 8982 Fax +44 171 542 5017</p>
